&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Sony Interactive Entertainment?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Sony Interactive Entertainment isn’t just the Best Place to Play — it’s also the Best Place to Work. Sony Interactive Entertainment (SIE) is the company behind the PlayStation brand. As a subsidiary of Sony Group Corporation, we’re part of a proud legacy of innovation and excellence. SIE is a dynamic technology company, delivering cutting-edge hardware and network services to more than 100 million people and an entertainment leader, home to some of the most beloved and recognizable intellectual properties (IP) in the world. Our role at SIE is to create and nurture the experiences under the PlayStation brand, a name synonymous with entertainment excellence and creativity.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Role Overview&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:2,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:40,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:20,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:210}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;The Director, IT Core Infrastructure is a senior technology leader responsible for the strategy, transformation, delivery, and operations of SIE’s global core infrastructure capabilities. The role leads a broad, globally distributed organization spanning internal networks and client access, core network connectivity across physical sites, cloud and on-premise infrastructure, and enterprise endpoint management across mobile, Linux, Windows, and Mac platforms.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Reporting to the Senior Director of IT, this role leads through multiple managers and is accountable for the performance, security, scalability, reliability, resilience, and user experience of Core Infrastructure services. The Director will translate enterprise strategy into clear priorities, investment decisions, and multi-year roadmaps while balancing transformation, operational performance, technical debt, risk, and cost.&lt;/span&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;This leader will drive the evolution of Core Infrastructure toward highly automated, software defined, self-service, and increasingly autonomous operating models. The role requires the technical credibility to lead across infrastructure disciplines and the breadth to shape technology strategy, lead transformation, influence across organizational boundaries, and take on expanded responsibilities as business needs evolve.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:2,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:20,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:210}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;What you&#39;ll be doing:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Functional Leadership &amp;amp; Accountability&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:2,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:40,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:120,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:200}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; Lead the Core Infrastructure organization across multiple teams and disciplines, providing clear direction, priorities, and accountability for outcomes.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;isselectedend&quot;&gt; Hold end-to-end accountability for service performance, including availability, reliability, security, resilience, and user experience.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;isselectedend&quot;&gt; Set priorities and make decisions across the Core Infrastructure portfolio, balancing operational needs, transformation, risk, technical debt, and investment.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; &lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;isselectedend&quot;&gt;Establish&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;isselectedend&quot;&gt; clear accountability across teams while empowering leaders to independently own their services and outcomes.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Infrastructure Strategy &amp;amp; Transformation&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:2,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:40,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:120,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:200}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; Define and execute a Core Infrastructure strategy and multi-year roadmap aligned with enterprise technology strategy and business priorities.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;isselectedend&quot;&gt; Lead the evolution toward highly automated, software defined, self-service, and increasingly autonomous infrastructure services.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;isselectedend&quot;&gt; Drive adoption of &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;isselectedend&quot;&gt;infrastructure&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;isselectedend&quot;&gt; as code, observability, AI enabled operations, and modern engineering practices to improve reliability, scalability, speed, and efficiency.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;isselectedend&quot;&gt; Simplify and standardize technology and service models, reducing complexity and improving the ability to &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;isselectedend&quot;&gt;operate&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;isselectedend&quot;&gt; globally at scale.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;isselectedend&quot;&gt; Partner with Information Security, Service &amp;amp; Support, and other technology organizations to develop integrated solutions and influence broader enterprise technology strategy.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Service Delivery &amp;amp; Operational Excellence&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:2,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:40,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:120,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:200}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; Establish strong operational practices across service management, incident response, change management, lifecycle management, capacity, observability, and resilience.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;isselectedend&quot;&gt; Ensure infrastructure services meet performance, security, availability, resilience, business continuity, and regulatory requirements.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;isselectedend&quot;&gt; Drive measurable improvements in reliability, employee experience, engineering productivity, automation, cost efficiency, and speed of delivery.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;isselectedend&quot;&gt; Use operational data and service performance measures to &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;isselectedend&quot;&gt;identify&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;isselectedend&quot;&gt; systemic issues, prioritize improvements, guide investment, and reduce manual operational effort.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Enterprise &amp;amp; Cross Functional Leadership&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:2,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:40,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:120,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:200}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; Serve as a trusted advisor to senior technology and business leaders on infrastructure strategy, investments, risks, and opportunities.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;isselectedend&quot;&gt; Lead complex enterprise initiatives that span multiple technology organizations and require alignment across priorities, ownership boundaries, and stakeholders.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;isselectedend&quot;&gt; Represent Core Infrastructure in enterprise planning, architecture, investment, risk, and transformation discussions, bringing a perspective beyond the immediate needs of the function.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;isselectedend&quot;&gt; Communicate complex technology decisions and &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;isselectedend&quot;&gt;tradeoffs clearly&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;isselectedend&quot;&gt; to executive audiences and build strong partnerships across technology and business organizations.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;People Leadership &amp;amp; Organizational Development&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:2,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:40,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:120,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:200}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;isselectedend&quot;&gt; Lead, coach, and develop a global organization of managers, architects, and senior engineers.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;isselectedend&quot;&gt; Build a high performing leadership team with clear accountability, strong ownership, and the ability to &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;isselectedend&quot;&gt;operate&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;isselectedend&quot;&gt; independently.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;isselectedend&quot;&gt; Develop leaders capable of owning major technology domains and enterprise outcomes, creating organizational depth and succession readiness.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;isselectedend&quot;&gt; Continually evolve organizational structure, skills, roles, and sourcing models to support changing business and technology needs.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;isselectedend&quot;&gt; Build a culture centered on engineering excellence, accountability, collaboration, continuous improvement, and measurable outcomes.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Financial, Portfolio &amp;amp; Resource Management&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:2,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:40,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:120,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:200}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;isselectedend&quot;&gt; Own financial planning, forecasting, investment prioritization, and resource allocation across the Core Infrastructure portfolio.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;isselectedend&quot;&gt; Make deliberate investment tradeoffs across transformation, lifecycle, technical debt, resilience, security, operational needs, and emerging capabilities.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;isselectedend&quot;&gt; Drive sustainable cost optimization and develop clear business cases for significant technology investments.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;isselectedend&quot;&gt; Manage strategic vendors, partners, and sourcing models to ensure performance, value, innovation, and alignment with SIE priorities.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Governance, Risk &amp;amp; Continuous Improvement&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:2,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:40,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:120,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:200}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; Establish appropriate governance, standards, and policies across Core Infrastructure while avoiding unnecessary process and operational overhead.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; &lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;isselectedend&quot;&gt;Identify&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;isselectedend&quot;&gt;, communicate, and mitigate risks related to availability, security, scalability, lifecycle, capacity, and resilience.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt; &lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;isselectedend&quot;&gt;Establish&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;isselectedend&quot;&gt; and monitor meaningful service level &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;isselectedend&quot;&gt;objectives&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;isselectedend&quot;&gt;, availability targets, operational health measures, and business outcome metrics.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;isselectedend&quot;&gt; Use data to drive accountability, investment decisions, and continuous improvement.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;isselectedend&quot;&gt; Challenge existing processes and operating models where they create unnecessary complexity or limit speed, automation, or scalability.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot; data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;isselectedend&quot;&gt; Contribute to the continued evolution of the broader IT operating model and technology organization.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we&#39;re looking for:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
